    <fr:title text="Safely Snarkifying the Ethereum Protocol">Safely Snarkifying the Ethereum Protocol</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Talk</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p><html:em>Abstract:</html:em> I will discuss ongoing work to safely snarkify the Ethereum protocol using formal verification. Expect to learn how formal verification delivers high-assurance code, and how we're using it on zkVMs, SNARKS, and the rest of the Ethereum protocol.</html:p>
    <html:p>links:
    <html:ul><html:li><fr:link href="/media/derek-sorensen-ethcc%5B9%5D.png" type="external">speaker image</fr:link></html:li>
        <html:li><fr:link href="https://ethcc.io/speakers/derek-sorensen" type="external">link to speaker profile on the event</fr:link></html:li>
        <html:li><fr:link href="https://ethcc.io/" type="external">event link</fr:link></html:li>
        <html:li><fr:link href="/slides/safely-snarkifying-slides-03-2026.pdf" type="external">slides</fr:link></html:li></html:ul></html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
